msgid "confirmmembership.emails.subject"
msgstr "Sletning af brugerkonto – Deletion of user account"

msgid "confirmmembership.emails.description"
msgstr "This email template is used to notify users that they need to reconfirm their membership"

msgid "confirmmembership.emails.body"
msgstr "ENGLISH BELOW  \n"
       "<br />\n"
       "<br />\n"
       "Kære {$fullname}<br />\n"
       "<br />\n"
       "Vi kan se, at det er længe siden, at du har været logget ind på din brugerkonto hos tidsskrift.dk og/eller evt. et eller flere af tidsskrifterne derpå ({$press}). Af sikkerhedshensyn og ift. databeskyttelsesforordningen sletter vi din brugerkonto, når der er gået mere end 1 år, siden du sidst har brugt den. Hvis du vil undgå, at din konto bliver slettet, skal du logge ind på https://tidsskrift.dk eller hos selve tidsskriftet, som din brugerkonto evt. er tilknyttet, indenfor den næste måned. Bliver din brugerkonto slettet, er du altid velkommen til at oprette en ny. <br />\n"
       "<br />\n"
       "Med venlig hilsen<br />\n"
       "Tidsskrift.dk, Det Kgl. Bibliotek \n"
       "<br />\n"
       "<br />\n"
       "ENGLISH:  \n"
       "<br />\n"
       "<br />\n"
       "Dear {$fullname},<br />\n"
       "<br />\n"
       "It has been a while since you have logged into your user account at tidsskrift.dk and/or maybe one or more of the journals hosted by tidsskrift.dk ({$press}). Due to security reasons and according to the General Data Protection Regulation, we will delete your user account, if is has been inactive for more than one year. If you want to prevent your account from being deleted, you need to log into your account at https://tidsskrift.dk or directly at the website of the journal, your user account is registered with, if any, within the next month. If your account is deleted, you are always welcome to create a new account.<br />\n"
       "<br />\n"
       "Best regards, <br />\n"
       "Tidsskrift.dk, The Royal Danish Library \n"
       "<br />\n"

msgid "confirmmembershipnojournals.emails.subject"
msgstr "Sletning af brugerkonto – Deletion of user account"

msgid "confirmmembershipnojournals.emails.description"
msgstr "This email template is used to notify users to reconfirm their membership when they are not subscribed to a specific journal"

msgid "confirmmembershipnojournals.emails.body"
msgstr "ENGLISH BELOW  \n"
       "<br />\n"
       "<br />\n"
       "Kære {$fullname}<br />\n"
       "<br />\n"
       "Vi kan se, at det er længe siden, at du har været logget ind på din brugerkonto hos tidsskrift.dk. Af sikkerhedshensyn og ift. databeskyttelsesforordningen sletter vi din brugerkonto, når der er gået mere end 1 år, siden du sidst har brugt den. Hvis du vil undgå, at din konto bliver slettet, skal du logge ind på https://tidsskrift.dk indenfor den næste måned. Bliver din brugerkonto slettet, er du altid velkommen til at oprette en ny.<br />\n"
       "<br />\n"
       "Med venlig hilsen<br />\n"
       "Tidsskrift.dk, Det Kgl. Bibliotek \n"
       "<br />\n"
       "<br />\n"
       "ENGLISH:  \n"
       "<br />\n"
       "<br />\n"
       "Dear {$fullname},<br />\n"
       "<br />\n"
       "It has been a while since you have logged into your user account at tidsskrift.dk. Due to security reasons and according to the General Data Protection Regulation, we will delete your user account, if it has been inactive for more than one year. If you want to prevent your account from being deleted, you need to log into your account at https://tidsskrift.dk within the next month. If your account is deleted, you are always welcome to create a new account.<br />\n"
       "<br />\n"
       "Best regards, <br />\n"
       "Tidsskrift.dk, The Royal Danish Library \n"
       "<br />\n"